config SYNCHROFLY_LOG_TWR_JSON
	bool "Print TWR/ranging JSON messages via printk"
	default y
	help
	  When enabled, ranging results are printed as JSON messages
	  over the debug channel (RTT/UART). Disable to suppress
	  these messages and reduce output bandwidth.